---
title: How a lock travels
board: 1400x1000
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as iPhone
  participant M as MacBook Pro
  participant C as iCloud (CloudKit)
  participant I as iPad (offline)
  Note over P,M: Pairing, once, same Wi-Fi
  P->>M: Bonjour finds "_twist._tcp"
  P-->>M: key exchange, both show 4719
  M->>P: Join: device added
  Note over P,I: Lock
  P->>M: lock until 15:40 (Wi-Fi, instant)
  P->>C: write session, then VPN goes on
  C-->>M: push (already locked, ignored)
  C-->>I: push when back online
  Note over P,I: Unwind on any device
  M->>P: open (Wi-Fi, instant)
  M->>C: session ended
  C-->>I: opens when online, or at 15:40 anyway
